spans.s:
(for वि-√ स्यन्द्, q.v.) Ā. -ष्यन्दते (accord. to Pāṇ. viii, 3, 72, वि-स्यन्दते is the only correct form when the reference is to living beings), to overflow, flow out (of a vessel; pr. p. वि-ष्यन्दमान), VS.; Br.; ŚrS.;
to flow in streams or abundantly, Hariv.; Bhaṭṭ.;
to dissolve, melt (intr.), Car.;
to cause to flow, MBh. :
Caus. -ष्यन्दयति, to cause to overflow (in अ-विष्यन्दयत्), ĀpŚr.;
to pour out, sprinkle, ŚBr.; Kauś.;
to dissolve, melt (trans.), Car.
